        -:  729:#define wxDEPRECATED_INLINE(func, body) wxDEPRECATED(func) { body }
        -:  730:
        -:  731:/*
        -:  732:    A macro to define a simple deprecated accessor.
        -:  733: */
        -:  734:#define wxDEPRECATED_ACCESSOR(func, what) wxDEPRECATED_INLINE(func, return what;)
        -:  735:
        -:  736:/*
        -:  737:   Special variant of the macro above which should be used for the functions
        -:  738:   which are deprecated but called by wx itself: this often happens with
